      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AUSSIE RAVEN (3) was below best at his last start when 6th at this track following a second place finish (28.50) at Bendigo two back. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and two minor placings from five starts. Should be very hard to beat this time. AMRON TOMMY (8) settled down midfield and held his position to the line when finishing 4th (25.75) at this track. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Has ability and is one of the better chances. SKY SPRINGER (1) doesn't have the best strike-rate but recent form is sound. Continues to race well, filling the minors at the last three starts, the latest when third (25.90) at this track. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and four minor placings to his credit. Can measure up. HIGH COTTON (2) is worth consideration after filling a hole last start.",
